{"overview":"ایچیگو هوشی‌میایا یک دختر معمولی و عادی مدرسهٔ متوسطه است. اما وقتی بهترین دوستش آوی او را به پیوستن به آکادمی آموزش ایستار، «آکادمی استارلایت» دعوت می‌کند، تمام دنیای او وارونه می‌شود. او در مواجهه با انواع رقیبان و یادگیری مسیر تبدیل شدن به یک ایستار، از کارت‌های «آیکاتسو» خود برای شرکت در تعداد بی‌شماری آزمون استفاده می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ichigo Hoshimiya is a regular, ordinary middle school girl. But when her best friend Aoi invites her to join the idol training academy, Starlight Academy, her whole world is turned upside down. As she encounters all kinds of rivals and learns what it takes to be an idol, she uses her Aikatsu Cards to challenge countless auditions.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":50,"y":2012,"poster":"/jZS1xA3Y40vqU8LMnxvsD5vweUK.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":51,"y":2013,"poster":"/yqRIaSw1AWrsvmWZ8dwtHHE4K6J.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":51,"y":2014,"poster":"/lRCPZp7nWvou8SnBadulxmzD3t3.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":26,"y":2015,"poster":"/kBpNPumr9DOuJwH13WQdh447EgR.jpg"}],"episodes":178,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"سومیره موروهوشی","role":"Ichigo Hoshimiya (voice)","photo":"/6AoZkW7NxgsWXkoCkTGDSgFcyao.jpg","en":"Sumire Morohoshi"},{"name":"大橋彩香","role":"Ran Shibuki (voice)","photo":"/2nvtejsD4sc6QNlPhGedKvr3VS1.jpg","en":"Ayaka Ohashi"},{"name":"آزوزا تادوکورو","role":"Aoi Kiriya (voice)","photo":"/kYQX26kSAUdPn5tDgMzdbjDSZdO.jpg","en":"Azusa Tadokoro"},{"name":"洲崎綾","role":"Mikuru Natsuki (voice)","photo":"/sApBzyEHk0hvpH1IIxYwfi4GS9p.jpg","en":"Aya Suzaki"},{"name":"寿美菜子","role":"Mizuki Kanzaki (voice)","photo":"/puocmMfvql6X1AvhFTolaV6Vh2r.jpg","en":"Minako Kotobuki"},{"name":"黒沢ともよ","role":"Otome Arisugawa (voice)","photo":"/eSRnva88YVcUXlDHdVrhier2SGU.jpg","en":"Tomoyo Kurosawa"},{"name":"福沙奈恵","role":"Lisa Shirakaba (voice)","photo":"/g0LIxupmJMuvSheyaJ10H0pkuGD.jpg","en":"Sanae Fuku"},{"name":"下地紫野","role":"Akari Ōzor